1
00:00:00,024 --> 00:00:03,524
(Penny:)Okay, sweetie, I know you think
you're explaining yourself...

2
00:00:03,694 --> 00:00:06,114
(Penny:)...but you're really not.

3
00:00:08,157 --> 00:00:09,487
(Sheldon:)Just come with me.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,240
[ON STEREO]
Tell me have you ever really

5
00:00:12,411 --> 00:00:14,041
Really, really ever loved a woman?

6
00:00:14,205 --> 00:00:15,245
(Sheldon:)Well?

7
00:00:15,414 --> 00:00:18,454
- Well, what?
- What does it mean?

8
00:00:18,792 --> 00:00:20,632
(Penny:)Come on, you went to college.

9
00:00:20,794 --> 00:00:23,084
Yes, but I was 11.

10
00:00:25,174 --> 00:00:28,674
(Penny:)A tie on the doorknob usually means
someone doesn't wanna be disturbed...

11
00:00:28,844 --> 00:00:33,184
(Penny:)...because they're, you know,
getting busy.

12
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:36,263
(Sheldon:)So you're saying
Leonard has a girl in there?

13
00:00:36,435 --> 00:00:41,235
(Penny:)Well, either that or he's lost his tie rack
and gotten really into Bryan Adams.

14
00:00:42,274 --> 00:00:44,314
LESLIE [FLATLY]:
Oh, Leonard, you magnificent beast.

15
00:00:47,821 --> 00:00:50,451
(Penny:)We really shouldn't be standing here.

16
00:00:52,451 --> 00:00:54,371
(Sheldon(entering living room):)This is very awkward.

17
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:58,020
(Penny:)Oh, come on. You know,
Leonard's had girls over before, right?

